        "title": "Viral Replication Cycles",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "All viral replication cycles share the same phases: attachment, entry, uncoating,\ngenome expression, genome replication, assembly, and release. The specifics differ\ndramatically by Baltimore class and host cell compartment."
    },
